# `scripts/examples/generated/` is deliberately NOT ignored here, and the reason is a gate that
# was silently a no-op: oxlint honours .gitignore unconditionally (no --no-ignore, no config
# negation, no cwd trick reaches it), so an ignored directory is a directory the linter reports
# zero files for and passes. `check-examples.mjs` removes the directory itself unless you ask for
# --keep, and fails if the lint pass ever sees no files again.

# Working notes, not artefacts for readers. RATING.md is a self-assessment whose value is
# internal — it drives the actionable list — and a self-scored project reads as marketing to
# anyone who did not write it.
RATING.md
.claude/plans/

